+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/grades/retire — retires a grade on the sheet. Body {"grade":"A|B|C"}. Another grade, or one
+# already retired, is refused with 422 and nothing is stored or recorded. Responds with the grades, as GET grades does.
